   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=flash1968\" data-kind=\"external\"><img src=\"@img:images/ring-recover_r9twm2pw.jpg\" alt=\"ring finder in bournemouth\" title=\"ring finder in bournemouth\" width=\"597\" height=\"334\"></a>"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Called to look for a couples wedding band, lost in the dry sand, initially pointed in the wrong direction, but gridded out the area, and using the <a href=\"@ctx3030/\" data-kind=\"internal\">GPS on the ctx3030</a>, covered the area, nothing found but ring pulls and bottletops, changed area gridded out again, 2nd signal Ring Recovered.. best wishes and a happy future for the couple.. Paul"
  }
 ],
